    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Forgefather's Seekers",
    "summary": "Your army gains:\n\n- 1 extra use of the **devastator doctrine** per battle.\n- +1 **S** for ranged attacks by friendly **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** units against a unit within 12\".\n\nWith a **VULKAN HE’STAN** unit in your army, your **INFERNUS SQUAD** units also gain:\n\n- **[Advance](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move)** and **[Fall Back moves](vsdata:core-rule/fall-back)** do not make the unit ineligible to **start an action**.\n- Starting an **action** does not make the unit ineligible to shoot.\n\n**Restrictions:** no **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** units from another Chapter; **SALAMANDERS** units are allowed.",
